        "TileImage": "$($repository 4fa109a2-d322-4f5e-a946-44e4445ce3d0).Image",
        "Description": "Hey, 47. Donnie Again.\r\rThose files we got are one hell of a puzzle. Nick&apos;s doing what he can, but we haven&apos;t found where Diana is or even if she&apos;s still alive. We&apos;ve only found one possible lead so far; a woman in Italy named Louisa Doria. We&apos;ve got a contract for two others in the area that we are using as an excuse to get you there.\r\rDo your thing, 47.\r\r-Donnie",
